```

#### Detailed Breakdown:

**Phase 1: MVP (8 weeks) - Core Features**

- Week 1-2: Setup & Architecture
  - Project scaffolding (React + .NET)
  - Database schema design
  - CI/CD pipeline
  - Design system & UI components
