### 8.1. Final Assessment

| Aspect                    | Score      | Comment                                                           |
| ------------------------- | ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Technical Feasibility** | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ | React + .NET là proven stack, all features doable                 |
| **Timeline Realistic**    | ⭐⭐⭐⭐☆  | 5-6 months realistic, có thể rush MVP trong 2-3 months            |
